@baseUrl = http://localhost:41003
@productId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@missingId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Place an order, then publish OrderPlacedNotification to both notification handlers
# @name placeOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Read the submitted order
@orderId = {{placeOrder.response.body.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### Cancel the order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel

### Read the cancelled order
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### Reject an invalid command before opening a transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 0
}

### The query exception handler returns a missing result
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{missingId}}

### The command exception action logs the failure
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{missingId}}/cancel
